    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Places and instruments",
     "texto": [
      "**Lapangan** and **kubangan** name places; **timbangan** and **meteran**, instruments. In English, the whole word changes: field, puddle, scale and tape measure."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dances",
     "texto": [
      "**Gerakan** is a movement and **penari**, the person who dances. Directions use **ke**: **ke depan**, forward; **ke kiri**, to the left."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
